  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a633f449938a194e9738ad7bc2507bb, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chat 10.5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textLine:
  - text: This is... incredible.
    speaker: 0
  - text: Indeed. Based on the type of technology that I'm scanning ahead, this edification
      seems to be something similar to a laboratory.
    speaker: 1
  - text: I think we hit the jackpot here.
    speaker: 0
  - text: Make sure to log any important piece of data that you ran into and grab
      every document that you can find. Use my scanner if you need help finding the
      latter ones.
    speaker: 1
  - text: Yeah, obviously.
    speaker: 0
  - text: By the way, where is this artificial light coming from? What energy source?
    speaker: 0
  - text: I think you will find the answer to that up ahead.
    speaker: 1
